                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "395d93a0-7598-3ae8-bab4-5af4128b21db",
                        "entry_id": "34020c76-b2e7-36f7-ad98-2ecf0def6b31",
                        "glosses": [
                            "деталь брекет-системы в виде замочка, накладываемого на губную поверхность зуба для нормализации их формы, размера, смыкания"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2592ceb6-d840-4040-8ce4-d2caeebbcf78",
                                "sense_id": "395d93a0-7598-3ae8-bab4-5af4128b21db",
                                "text": "«Брекеты» (в переводе с английского — замо́к) фиксируются только на постоянные зубы."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "99fa9294-9848-3369-8ea8-7060b471a4f4",
                        "entry_id": "34020c76-b2e7-36f7-ad98-2ecf0def6b31",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мн. ч. то же, что брекет-система"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8afb264c-5648-4c9e-b403-d22686d3f550",
                                "sense_id": "99fa9294-9848-3369-8ea8-7060b471a4f4",
                                "text": "Рекомендуется ирригатор для людей, носящих зубные протезы, коронки и другие конструкции (брекеты, ретейнеры и т. д.), которые невозможно полноценно очистить зубной щёткой."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ed75bb5d-2bb5-4f56-9d4c-ed5c0652e172",
                        "source_entry_id": "34020c76-b2e7-36f7-ad98-2ecf0def6b31",
                        "target_lang_word": "bracket",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bracket",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94c3c7a2-5106-3679-8845-c32a8669af85",
                                        "entry_id": "b0e4228b-df9d-346a-84e9-ebdf5a9b827f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fixture attached to a wall to hold up a shelf."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f5e75ea-24ab-3ca6-bc45-69cc0623cba0",
                                        "entry_id": "b0e4228b-df9d-346a-84e9-ebdf5a9b827f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any intermediate object that connects a smaller part to a larger part, the smaller part typically projecting sideways from the larger part."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c237f0dd-6b74-4d38-8b41-6150f1025212",
                                                "sense_id": "0f5e75ea-24ab-3ca6-bc45-69cc0623cba0",
                                                "text": "To determine if your frame has this bottom bracket type, look for a notched and possibly knurled lockring on the left side (the side without the chainrings)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1d901d5-6333-4749-8778-d2d65b2d0163",
                                                "sense_id": "0f5e75ea-24ab-3ca6-bc45-69cc0623cba0",
                                                "text": "Not only does the attachment on the tooth surface (called a bracket) allow the tooth to be moved vertically or tilted, but also a force couple can be generated by the interaction between the bracket and an archwire running through the bracket."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bbe2eba3-6685-33d2-b796-295813bb6ba2",
                                        "entry_id": "b0e4228b-df9d-346a-84e9-ebdf5a9b827f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short crooked timber, resembling a knee, used as a support."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d05d7a6b-47e4-3c5c-b3ea-ebc48bacc38a",
                                        "entry_id": "b0e4228b-df9d-346a-84e9-ebdf5a9b827f",
